# Cloudflare Pages response headers (https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/headers/).
# The site (itjustlogs.dev) loads everything here from https://assets.itjustlogs.dev.
# JSON keeps Pages' default (public, max-age=0, must-revalidate): data is fresh on every load.
# Pictures and clips are kept a day; a replaced one only shows sooner under a new URL (the site's
# PORTRAIT_V and banners.json's gameArtV add ?v= for that).

/*
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *

/*.webp
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400
/*.png
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400
/*.jpg
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400
/*.jpeg
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400
/*.gif
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400
/*.svg
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400
/*.webm
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400
/*.mp4
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400
